\label{prop:cohom}
Suppose that $T$ is an IET of hyperbolic periodic type. Let $\omega\in{\mathbb{R}}^{\mathcal A}$ be a non-zero log-slope vector of stable type. Then there exists a H\"older continuous solution $v:I\to{\mathbb{R}}$ to the cohomological equation $\phi_\omega=v\circ T-v$ such that
