Let $f\in \operatorname{Aff}(T,\omega)$ be an AIET of hyperbolic periodic type, semi-conjugated via $h:I\to I$ to a self-similar IET $T=(\pi,\lambda)$, with the log-slope vector $\omega\neq 0$ of stable type. Then $h$ is a homeomorphism such that
